{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47886","headline":"孙玄照琴中歌赠王仙仙 · 王仙仙","name":"孙玄照琴中歌赠王仙仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相如曾作凤兮吟，昔被文君会此音。\n今日孤鸾还独语，痛哉仙子不弹琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王仙仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}